103	    }
104	
105	    /**
106	     * Derive the owner's read-only {@code timezone}: the IANA timezone name for the owner's
107	     * locality/region, looked up from the fixed region-to-timezone table ({@code NSW->Australia/Sydney,
108	     * VIC->Australia/Melbourne, QLD->Australia/Brisbane}). The region is the same value reported as the
